flowchart LR
    subgraph Sources[Messy storage world]
        Local[Local folders]
        Cloud[NAS and cloud drives]
        Buckets[S3 buckets]
        Markets[Marketplace exports]
    end

    Connector[Storage connector]
    Pack[(MeshPack snapshot<br/>.meshpack / .mpack ZIP)]
    Manifest[manifest.json<br/>first archive entry]
    Shards[index/ shards<br/>deterministic file list]
    Resources[resources/<br/>previews and small files]
    Sidecar[.meshpack.integrity<br/>detached pack hash]
    Validator[Integrity and conformance validation]
    Workers[Provider-agnostic workers]
    Consumers[Importers, viewers, marketplaces]

    Sources --> Connector --> Pack
    Pack --> Manifest
    Pack --> Shards
    Pack --> Resources
    Sidecar -. verifies .-> Pack
    Manifest --> Validator
    Shards --> Validator
    Resources --> Validator
    Sidecar --> Validator
    Validator --> Workers --> Consumers
